// Package app is where the {{.Service}} API service is put together.
//
// This file is yours: devkit creates it once and never rewrites it, while
// cmd/{{.Service}}/main.go belongs to the framework and is replaced by
// `devkit update`. So everything specific to this service goes here (or into
// packages you add), and main.go is never edited.
//
// 本文件归你所有：devkit 只创建一次，之后不会改写。而 cmd/{{.Service}}/main.go 属于
// 框架，每次 `devkit update` 都会被替换。所以本服务特有的一切都写在这里（或你自己
// 新增的包里），不要去修改 main.go。
package app

import (
	"github.com/cloudwego/hertz/pkg/app/server"

	"{{.CommonModule}}/hertzx"
)

// Config is the whole configuration of the service, loaded from
// conf/<APP_ENV>.yaml. The embedded hertzx.Config is the part the framework
// reads (service, nacos, log, shutdown; see conf/README.md). Add your own
// sections next to it, as fields, and the matching keys to the YAML files.
//
// Config 是本服务的完整配置，从 conf/<APP_ENV>.yaml 加载。内嵌的 hertzx.Config 是
// 框架读取的部分（service、nacos、log、shutdown，见 conf/README.zh-CN.md）。你自己的
// 配置节作为字段加在它旁边，并在 YAML 里写上对应的内容。
type Config struct {
	hertzx.Config `yaml:",inline"`
}

// Setup is called once at start-up, after the configuration is loaded and the
// logger is installed, before the first request is served. Create here what
// the routes need and put it into package deps, add middleware that applies to
// every route with h.Use, and register cleanup with hertzx.OnShutdown: it runs
// in reverse order after the service has left Nacos and the last request in
// progress has finished. Returning an error stops the start with a plain
// message.
//
// The client of an RPC service (its IDL is listed in idl.mk, `make gen` has
// generated kitex_gen/, deps/deps.go declares `var User userservice.Client`):
